    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1022">

                <pb facs="0988" n="890" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg890"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Duke
                            de Arcos.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September 17,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 114.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 12th instant, in which you transmit an expression of the
                    deep sympathy felt by His Majesty’s Government and by Her Majesty the Queen
                    Regent in view of the terrible disaster in Texas.</p>
                <pb facs="0989" n="891" xml:id="pg891"/>
                <p>Your note has been communicated to the President, who charges me to express his
                    sincere appreciation of the sympathetic, message transmitted by your
                    Government.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
